Sval: getUserMedia:revoke stops the camera or the microphone alone

The revoke takes a window id and stops every camera and microphone in the
window, or a `screen:` id and stops screen capture. Sval's site menu offers a
Stop for each live device, so a `camera:` or `microphone:` id stops that
source alone and leaves the window's other captures running.

